* uktr: r: Positive Sequence Impedance: Short-Circuit Voltage uk in %
* pcutr: r: Positive Sequence Impedance: Copper Losses in kW
* uk0tr: r: Zero Sequence Impedance: Short-Circuit Voltage uk0 in %
* ur0tr: r: Zero Sequence Impedance: SHC-Voltage (Re(uk0)) uk0r in %
